Television\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JdGTzKlGJycQ7kNvwGJYQSc&_nc_oc=AdklNQ2CiPW38RV_Di59dLWOINxoLokYzRsVTuAE9PXTfsziRL5Nv_pV-kpAiT-9oTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyo1e_8x46x8H6mG-8FbwnRY2hkaj9KAOJAuhuX2LkuJA&oe=69BBFFD5"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HOHL911qLXoQ7kNvwEBEAae&_nc_oc=AdlV6511_ANx9mOBzn7sSa0K1uSpXpCfsD3Qk8Y-8LZfFZWiBUZXL5Gkr_x2TkrG0p0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxkGL1HzL33klEdQgUMWOncx1Dbqaad6-D4FJIUxrGfqw&oe=69BBE4A7"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR Cover Art.png", "id": "678364797690874", "image_typ